- **Stop it:** `sudo systemctl stop pyquant-orchestra`
- **Switch LIVE ↔ PAPER:** edit `.env`'s `PYQUANT_MODE` line, then
  `sudo systemctl restart pyquant-orchestra` (per `DOCS.md` Section 6,
